  "question": {
    "text": "The equation of the tangent to the parabola <math><msup><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi></math> whose slope is positive and which also touches <math><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></math> is"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    }
  ],
